AppNeta Intelligent Alarm ({S 304}) - {S 306} on item {S 308}

SYMPTOMS:

An AppNeta Intelligent Alarms WebErrors rule was triggered, indicating an HTTP/web
transaction error against the monitored web target.

PROBABLE CAUSES:

A web server error response, application fault, or connectivity issue affecting the
monitored web target, as determined by AppNeta's own monitoring criteria for this rule.

RECOMMENDED ACTIONS:

Review this alarm's details in AppNeta's Intelligent Alarms console to determine root cause.
This alarm clears automatically when AppNeta reports the underlying condition resolved.
